<div class="kicker">
  Frequently Asked Questions
</div>

<h2 class="title">
  Before You Hit <span>the Mats</span>
</h2>

<p class="lead">
  Tap a question to see the answer.
</p>


<div class="faq">

<details>
<summary>
  What should I wear to my first class?
</summary>
<div class="faq-answer">
  Follow the current class-specific
  uniform requirements. If you're unsure,
  ask the academy before class.
</div>
</details>


<details>
<summary>
  Do I need to be in shape before I start?
</summary>
<div class="faq-answer">
  No. Training is one of the ways you'll
  build fitness. Start at your own pace
  and communicate with your coach.
</div>
</details>


<details>
<summary>
  Do I need martial arts experience?
</summary>
<div class="faq-answer">
  No. New students begin with fundamentals
  and gradually build their skills.
</div>
</details>


<details>
<summary>
  What if I don't understand a technique?
</summary>
<div class="faq-answer">
  Ask questions. Learning takes time,
  and everyone was new once.
</div>
